or Lout=strideLin+2paddingdilation(kernel_size1)1+1 Examples: >>> # pool of size=3, stride=2 >>> m = nn.MaxPool1d(3, stride=2) >>> input = torch.randn(20, 16, 50) >>> output = m(input)
